1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,617
Conclusions fail the opposite way: they repeat the introduction word for word, or bring in a brand new idea.

2
00:00:07,617 --> 00:00:16,822
A good one does three small things: it restates the position in different words, says what should follow, and ends on a short sentence.

3
00:00:16,822 --> 00:00:22,955
Never begin with last but not the least, and never end with so, this is my essay.

